  "rationale": "46 units of Multigrain Bread 200G at Outlet 04 (South Bengaluru) are projected unsold before the expiry deadline on 2026-09-16; doing nothing writes off ₹2697 and a blanket 20% markdown costs ₹1687. This play uses a bundle with SKU-BUTTER-400G at ₹115 for 334 consented customers (Tea connoisseurs, Dairy occasionals, Sweets occasionals, Everyday staples shoppers, Personal care regulars, Festival sweets loyalists): expected 30 units, margin ₹313, discount cost ₹304, waste avoided ₹1781 (CI 2 to 89 units; prior n 20, measured n 0). Policy v1: \"2. Prefer bundles and transfers over blanket markdowns; markdowns are the last lever.\" This bundle play pairs the multigrain bread with butter at a bundle price of 115 INR, which respects the 8% bakery margin floor while avoiding waste. It is preferred by policy over blanket markdowns.",
